## For the lead

1. **Short path at 64 (APPROACH.md).** At 96 sessions a year, a 64-session path drops a third of the days (32), at
   most 5 a unit, Fluency and Application only. Pick: keep 64 as written, with the course page saying a third of the
   practice goes; the other choice is a 72-session short path (two and a quarter a week), which APPROACH's 60 to 64
   range would need changed (Cory's call if it changes).
2. **The held retest day (unit 15).** Unit 15's retest is held to grade 8 course day 47 so the plan runs a term. The
   frame's calendar places unit 15 on days 1 to 12; the scope sets the held day's school day in days.csv. Pick: keep
   it; the other way is to move the retest into the mid-year check's knowledge task, which makes a check carry an
   owned row's teaching.
3. **Neighbor frames.** The SEL and dance 6 to 8 frames are being written at the same time (Pending lines in
   Cross-subject). Health 6 to 8 landed during this write and is cited by unit and week.
4. **Cost.** About $785 across the band from nothing (grade 6 $355, grade 7 $65, grade 8 $365); floor-hockey sticks
   ($150), compasses ($75) and youth life jackets ($100) are most of it. The K to 2 fix report's money question to
   Cory (mats, life jackets, a per-year ceiling) covers this band too.
5. **Cultural picks to confirm.** Tinikling was checked only at secondary sources (no national culture commission page
   found in one search), the Virginia Reel and Naadam were not checked: the sensitivity agent checks each at the named
   source or swaps it. Capoeira carries hard history (slavery in Brazil); the case card needs the sensitivity read
   before writing.
6. **After-core check clash, for the lead's calendar pass.** Every PE mid-year check is in week 17 (school days 82
   and 84) and every year-end check in week 32 (a finals week, stagger rule 3). Health 6 to 8, which landed during
   this write, also checks on school day 84 in grades 6, 7 and 8, so the two share a day in each grade. Per the brief
   PE's weeks were not shuffled to dodge it. If the lead wants them apart, PE's free choices off core check days
   are weeks 19 to 21 in grades 6 and 7, and weeks 19 and 21 to 23 in grade 8 (unit boundaries move with them).
7. **No row changes needed.** Every row is placed as written; no handoff link is missing.

